# Jade Court

## Monorepo layout

- `apps/web` — Vite React PWA (UI, routing, room client)
- `apps/server` — Hono REST + WebSocket (rooms, move validation)
- `packages/xiangqi-engine` — shared rules, AI, coach (no React deps)

## Game logic

- Port and maintain engine logic **only** in `packages/xiangqi-engine`.
- The server **re-validates every online move** with the same engine package; do not duplicate rules on the server.

## UI and theme

- Fixed Jade Court look: bamboo board tones, **flat** pieces (`pcs-flat`), jade accent (`#1F9E81`), warm cream background.
- **Tailwind CSS v4** — app chrome uses utilities and `@layer components` in `apps/web/src/index.css`; board/piece DOM stays in `apps/web/src/styles/board.css`.
- **No Tweaks panel** — `applyTheme()` in `apps/web/src/lib/theme.ts` only sets `pcs-flat` on `body` at startup.

## Code style

- Match existing patterns in the file you are editing.
- Prefer minimal, focused diffs over broad refactors.

## Plans

- Do **not** edit files under `.cursor/plans/` unless the user explicitly asks.
